t("Soul Leech", "Alma Drenar", "talent name")
t("Consume Soul", "Consume Alma", "talent name")
t("Torture Souls", "Tortura Almas", "talent name")
t("Reaping", "Reacción", "talent name")

t("Each time you or your undead minions deal damage to a creature you apply Soul Leech to them.\n\t\tIf a creature dies with this effect active, you steal its soul.\n\t\tStrong creatures and bosses are so overflowing with soul power that you steal a fragment of their soul every few turns:\n\t\t%s- rare: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- unique: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- boss: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- elite boss: at most every %d turns#WHITE#\n\n\t\tAlso increases your maximum souls capacity by %d .", "Cada vez que tú o tus esbirros no muertos infligen daño a una criatura, le aplicas Ladrón de Almas.\\n\\t\\tSi una criatura muere con este efecto activo, le robas el alma.\\n\\t\\tLas criaturas fuertes tienen más almas que robar.", "tformat")
t("Each time you or your undead minions deal damage to a creature you apply Soul Leech to them.\n\t\tIf a creature dies with this effect active, you steal its soul.\n\t\tStrong creatures and bosses are so overflowing with soul power that you steal a fragment of their soul every few turns:\n\t\t%s- rare: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- unique: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- boss: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- elite boss: at most every %d turns#WHITE#\n\n\t\tAlso increases your m"Cada vez que tú o sus secuaces no muertos hacen daño a una criatura que aplican Alma Leech a ellos.\\n\\t\\ t Si una criatura muere con este efecto activo, tú roba tu alma.\\n\\t\\t\\tStrong criaturas y patrones están tan desbordando con el poder del alma que tú roba un fragmento de tu alma cada pocos turnos:\\n\\t%s- raro: en la mayoría de cada §%d § turn\\n\\t\\t\\t§9 turns- unique: at most every %d turn\\t. %d %s %d %s %d %d"nique: at most every %d turn\t.", "tformat")
t("Each time you or your undead minions deal damage to a creature you apply Soul Leech to them.\n\t\tIf a creature dies with this effect active, you steal its soul.\n\t\tStrong creatures and bosses are so overflowing with soul power that you steal a fragment of their soul every few turns:\n\t\t%s- rare: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- unique: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- boss: at most every %d turns\n\t\t%s- elite boss: at most every %d turns#WHI"Cada vez que tú o sus secuaces no muertos hacen daño a una criatura que aplican Alma Leech a ellos.\\n\\t\\ t Si una criatura muere con este efecto activo, tú roba tu alma.\\n\\t\\t\\tStrong criaturas y patrones están tan desbordando con el poder del alma que tú roba un fragmento de tu alma cada pocos turnos:\\n\\t%s- raro: en la mayoría de cada §%d § turn\\n\\t\\t\\t§9 turns- unique: at most every %d turn\\t. %d %s %d %s %d %d"da §%d § turn\n\t\t\t§9 turns- unique: at most every %d turn\t.", "tformat")
t("Consume a soul whole to rebuild your body, healing you for %d and generating %d mana.\n\t\tIf used below 1 life the surge increases your spellpower by %d for 10 turns.\n\t\tThe heal and mana increases with your Spellpower.", "Consuma un alma entera para reconstruir tu cuerpo, sanándote para %d y generando %d mana.\nSi se usa debajo de 1 vida, el aumento aumentas tu potencia de ortografía por %d durante 10 vueltas.\nLa curas y maná aumentas con tu poder de pago.", "tformat")
t("Unleash dark forces to all foes in sight that are afflicted by Soul Leech, dealing %0.2f frostdusk damage to them and tearing apart their souls.\n\t\tThis returns up to %d souls to you (one for each foe hit).\n\t\tThe damage increases with your Spellpower.", "Desata fuerzas oscuras a todos los enemigos a la vista que están afligidos por Soul Leech, traficando daño de %0.2f frostdusk a ellos y destrozando sus almas.\nEsto vuelve a %d almas para ustedes (uno para cada golpe de enemigo).\nEl daño aumentas con tu poder de pago.", "tformat")
t("You draw constant power from the souls you hold within your grasp.\n\t\tIf you hold at least 2, your mana regeneration is increased by %0.1f per turn.\n\t\tIf you hold at least 5, your spellpower is increased by %d.\n\t\tIf you hold at least 8, all your resistances are increased by %d.", "Tú sacas el poder constante de las almas que sostienes dentro de tu alcance.\nSi mantienes al menos 2, tu regeneración de maná se incrementa por %0.1f por turno.\nSi tienes por lo menos 5, tu fuerza de hechizo se aumenta por %d.\nSi tienes al menos 8, todas tus resistencias se incrementan por %d.", "tformat")
